<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-ISTANBULSPOR BEAT LYON IN INTERTOTO CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ISTANBULSPOR BEAT LYON IN INTERTOTO CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbulspor of Turkey beat France's Olympique Lyon 2-1 (halftime 2-1) in their Intertoto Cup semifinal first leg on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Istanbulspor: Yalcin 18, 25 pen</p>
<p>Lyon: Caveglia 5</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
</text>
